data: {"id": "9553617021a24219-thinking-parallel_evidence-620", "run_id": "9553617021a24219", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已接收 ReAct 启动前的可观测性基线结果，现在按计划执行 Kubernetes 核心验证。\n\n### 计划执行\n1. `kubectl get pod workload -n aiops-case-11 -o yaml` (critical: 获取 Pod YAML 中的 finalizers, deletionTimestamp, nodeName)\n2. `kubectl describe pod workload -n aiops-case-11` (critical: 获取 termination, volume, node 事件)\n3. `kubectl get node <nodeName> -o yaml` (important: 根据 Pod 的 nodeName 检查节点状态)\n4. `kubectl get deployments,statefulsets,jobs -n aiops-case-11` (important: 检查 owner workload 状态)\n5. `execute_pod_promql` (critical: 获取 Pod 生命周期和", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789099730406, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

